DTSTART:20270108T071500Z
DTEND:20270108T074500Z
SUMMARY:Deadline 23:45 PST: Chroma Awards: Season 2 (AI film\, music video 
 and game competition)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 07 Jan 2027 at 23:45 PST.\n\nSeason 2 of the Chroma Awar
 ds\, a global competition for work made with generative AI tools\, across 
 film and TV\, advertising\, music video\, game\, behind-the-scenes and stu
 dent divisions. Any AI tools may be used\; projects must have been made af
 ter 1 February 2026. No age or country restriction found. Free to enter. S
 ponsor-driven: the Ad divisions are commercial briefs.\n\nOrganisation: Ch
 roma Awards (incubated by ElevenLabs\, with 100+ AI tool sponsors)\nLocati
 on: Online. Open to creators worldwide.\nAward: USD 263\,750 in cash acros
 s divisions per the official page (Film/TV USD 38\,000\, Ad USD 35\,000\, 
 Music Video USD 24\,000\, Game USD 20\,500\, Behind-the-Scenes USD 17\,000
 \, Student about USD 55\,000-60\,500). Organisers also advertise USD 450\,
 000+ including sponsor tool credits and travel perks. Free to enter.\nDura
 tion: One-off competition. Winners announced 11 February 2027.\n\nMore: ht
 tps://chromaawards.com/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=r
 eferral
URL:https://chromaawards.com/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_med
 ium=referral
LOCATION:Online. Open to creators worldwide.
END:VEVENT
