SUMMARY:Deadline 13:00 CET: BBBank Award in Projection Mapping 2027: PLAYGR
 OUND (ZKM\, SCHLOSSLICHTSPIELE Karlsruhe)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 25 Nov 2026 at 13:00 CET.\n\nOpen call for a 7-minute pr
 ojection mapping on the Karlsruhe palace facade\, on the 2027 festival the
 me Playground (The Art of Playing). For artists\, designers\, studios and 
 collectives working in projection mapping\; ZKM provides curatorial and te
 chnical coaching.\n\nOrganisation: ZKM | Center for Art and Media Karlsruh
 e\, with BBBank and SCHLOSSLICHTSPIELE Karlsruhe\nLocation: Karlsruhe\, Ge
 rmany (palace facade). Open internationally.\nAward: EUR 10\,000 prize if 
 the selected concept is realised\, plus EUR 10\,000 production funding cov
 ering fees and technology. No application fee.\nDuration: 7-minute work pr
 emiering at SCHLOSSLICHTSPIELE Karlsruhe 2027 (festival 12 August to 13 Se
 ptember 2027) and shown throughout the festival.\n\nMore: https://zkm.de/e
 n/call-for-entries-bbbank-award-in-projection-mapping-2027?utm_source=arti
 ficialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://zkm.de/en/call-for-entries-bbbank-award-in-projection-mapping-2
 027?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Karlsruhe\, Germany (palace facade). Open internationally.
